, Karim and {Fernandez-Canal}, Charlotte and Gay, Samuel and Lebouc, Marie and Bougon, David and Escudier, Etienne and Sirodot, Michel and Levrat, Albrice and Courouau, Alix and Duranteau, Jacques and Rodrigues, Aurore and Makouche, Naima and Francony, Gilles and Vincent, Olivier and Boucheix, Perrine and Schilte, Clotilde and Adolle, Anais and Gargadennec, Thomas and Dias, Patricia and Desanglois, Gwenaelle and Meheut, Alexia and Cam, Pauline and Meyfroidt, Geert and Mebis, Liese and Hendrickx, Alexandra and Wouters, Pieetr and Van Hulle, Sylvia and D'Hondt, Alain and Beumier, Marjorie and Burgeois, Marc and Simonet, Olivier and Vallot, Frederic and Centeno, Pablo and Anchorena, Matias and Benavente, Ximena and D'Onofrio, Maximilian and Funes, Nydia and Barra De Oca, Antonio and Izzo, Gabriela and Castelain, Charlotte and Soetens, Filippo and Arias, Mario and Morocho, Diego and Jabaja, Manuel and Tutillo, Diego and Popugaev, Stan and Dias, Celeste and Perez Solada, Elena and Justo, Pilar and Lopez Gomez, Amparo and Alcantara, Sara and Chico, Francisco and Garcia, Maria Fernanda and Picoita, Fabricio and Velasco Eichler, Stela and Nonticuri Bianchi, Gabriela and Britz, Jo{\~a}o Pedro and Almeida Pimentel, Jaqueline and Fernandes, M{\'a}rio S{\'e}rgio and Gharsallah, Hedi and Hajjej, Zied and Samoud, Walid and Grebenchikov, Oleg and Likhvantsev, Valery and Stroiteleva, Elena and Markou, Nikolaos and Bakali, Dimitra and Koutrafouri, Dionysia and Subhy Alsheikhly, Ahmed and Giacomucci, Angelo and Maccherani, Sara and Horn, Janneke and Elbahnasawy, Mohamed and Ahmadi, Arezoo and Decaesteker, Lien and Decruyenaere, Daphne and Demeersseman, Ruth and Devriendt, Yves and Embo, Karen and Van Duijn, Ditty and Ormskerk, Patricia and {Glasbergen-van Beijeren}, Melanie and Njimi, Hassane and Cariou, Alain and Lelubre, Christophe and Ristagno, Giuseppe and Stocchetti, Nino and Oddo, Mauro and De Deyne, Cathy and Citerio, Giuseppe},
  year = 2024,
